{"article_id": 591, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.5.4", "content": "厨房、卫生间的室内净高不应低于2.20m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 592, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.5.5", "content": "厨房、卫生间内排水横管下表面与楼面、地面净距不得低于1.90m，且不得影响门、窗扇开启。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 593, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.6.1", "content": "每套住宅宜设阳台或平台。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 595, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.6.3", "content": "阳台栏板或栏杆净高，六层及六层以下不应低于1.05m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 598, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.7.4", "content": "套内楼梯的踏步宽度不应小于0.22m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 600, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.8.2", "content": "凸窗窗台高度低于或等于0.45m时，防护高度从窗台面起算不应低于0.90m", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 601, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "5.8.7", "content": "共用外门门洞洞口宽度最小为1.20m，洞口高度最小为2.00m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 603, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "6.1.2", "content": "公共出入口台阶高度超过0.70m并侧面临空时，应设置防护设施，防护设施净高不应低于1.05m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 604, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "6.1.3", "content": "外廊、内天井及上人屋面等临空处的栏杆净高，六层及六层以下不应低于1.05m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 605, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "6.1.4", "content": "公共出入口台阶踏步宽度不宜小于0.30m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 606, "specification": "GB50096-2011", "specification_name": "GB50096-2011住宅设计规范20211220（强条）", "clause_number": "6.2.1", "content": "十层以下的住宅建筑，当住宅单元任一层的建筑面积大于650m2，该住宅单元每层的安全出口不应少于2个。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
