{"article_id": 791, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "1.0.1", "content": "为保障无障碍环境建设中无障碍设施的建设和运行维护，依据国家相关法律法规，制定本规范。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 795, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "1.0.3 3", "content": "无障碍设施的建设和运行维护应遵循下列基本原则：保证系统性及无障碍设施之间有效衔接；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 801, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.1.2", "content": "无障碍通行流线上的标识物、垃圾桶、座椅、灯柱、隔离墩、地灯和地面布线（线槽）等设施均不应妨碍行动障碍者的独立通行。固定在无障碍通道、轮椅坡道、楼梯的墙或柱面上的物体，突出部分大于100mm且底面距地面高度小于2.00m时，其底面距地面高度不应大于600mm，且应保证有效通行净宽。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 802, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.1.3", "content": "无障碍通行流线在临近地形险要地段处应设置安全防护设施，必要时应同时设置安全警示线。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 805, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.2.2", "content": "无障碍通道的通行净宽不应小于1.20m，人员密集的公共场所的通行净宽不应小于1.80m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 808, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.2.5", "content": "自动扶梯、楼梯的下部和其他室内外低矮空间可以进入时，应在净高不大于2.00m处采取安全阻挡措施。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 809, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.3.1 1", "content": "轮椅坡道的坡度和坡段提升高度应符合下列规定：横向坡度不应大于1：50，纵向坡度不应大于1：12，当条件受限且坡段起止点的高差不大于150mm时，纵向坡度不应大于1：10；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 811, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.3.2", "content": "轮椅坡道的通行净宽不应小于1.20m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 814, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.3.5", "content": "设置扶手的轮椅坡道的临空侧应采取安全阻挡措施。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 818, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.4.2", "content": "除平坡出入口外，无障碍出入口的门前应设置平台；在门完全开启的状态下，平台的净深度不应小于1.50m；无障碍出入口的上方应设置雨篷。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 833, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.5.9", "content": "满足无障碍要求的双向开启的门应在可视高度部分安装观察窗，通视部分的下沿距地面高度不应大于850mm。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 836, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.6.1 3", "content": "无障碍电梯的候梯厅应符合下列规定：呼叫按钮前应设置提示盲道；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 843, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.6.5 1", "content": "升降平台应符合下列规定：深度不应小于1.20m，宽度不应小于900mm，应设扶手、安全挡板和呼叫控制按钮，呼叫控制按钮的高度应符合本规范第2.6.1条的有关规定；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 844, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.6.5 2", "content": "升降平台应符合下列规定：应采用防止误入的安全防护措施；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 846, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.7.1 1", "content": "视觉障碍者主要使用的楼梯和台阶应符合下列规定：距踏步起点和终点250mm～300mm处应设置提示盲道，提示盲道的长度应与梯段的宽度相对应；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 861, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.9.6", "content": "无障碍小汽（客）车上客和落客区的尺寸不应小于2.40m×7.00m，和人行通道有高差处应设置缘石坡道，且应与无障碍通道衔接。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 863, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.10.2", "content": "缘石坡道的坡口与车行道之间应无高差。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 864, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.10.3", "content": "缘石坡道距坡道下口路缘石250mm～300mm处应设置提示盲道，提示盲道的长度应与缘石坡道的宽度相对应。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 868, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.10.5?2", "content": "缘石坡道的宽度应符合下列规定：三面坡缘石坡道的正面坡道宽度不应小于1.20m；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 870, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "2.10.6", "content": "缘石坡道顶端处应留有过渡空间，过渡空间的宽度不应小于900mm。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 882, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.7 1", "content": "无障碍服务设施内安装的部件应符合下列规定：应安装牢固；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 893, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.10 1", "content": "无障碍洗手盆应符合下列规定：台面距地面高度不应大于800mm，水嘴中心距侧墙不应小于550mm，其下部应留出不小于宽750mm、高650mm、距地面高度250mm范围内进深不小于450mm、其他部分进深不小于250mm的容膝容脚空间；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 894, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.10 2", "content": "无障碍洗手盆应符合下列规定：应在洗手盆上方安装镜子，镜子反光面的底端距地面的高度不应大于1.00m；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 900, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.11 5", "content": "无障碍淋浴间应符合下列规定：控制淋浴的开关距地面高度不应大于1.00m；应设置一个手持的喷头，其支架高度距地面高度不应大于1.20m，淋浴软管长度不应小于1.50m。", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 901, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.12 1", "content": "无障碍盆浴间应符合下列规定：浴盆侧面应设不小于1500mm×800mm的净空间，和浴盆平行的一边的长度不应小于1.50m；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
{"article_id": 904, "specification": "GB55019-2021", "specification_name": "建筑与市政工程无障碍通用规范GB55019-2021", "clause_number": "3.1.13 1", "content": "无障碍厨房应符合下列规定：厨房设施和电器应方便乘轮椅者靠近和使用；", "split": "pilot", "annotation_status": "unannotated", "annotations": {"annotator_a": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "annotator_b": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}, "adjudicated": {"entities": [], "relations": [], "rules": []}}}
